  "estimatedSeconds": 90,
  "stem": "The tangent to the curve $y = \\mathrm{e}^{-x} + 2x$ at the point where $x = \\ln 2$ crosses the $y$-axis at $(0, c)$. Find $c$, correct to 3 significant figures.",
